<resources>
    <!-- Deliberately low-key: this is what shows in the app drawer, Settings,
         and the recent-apps switcher — a customer sees this name and icon,
         so it should read as an unremarkable device utility, not a brand.
         It must still be visible and truthful in what it does when opened
         or inspected in Settings — see the note in DevicePolicyHelper.kt
         about why this app is never hidden from the user. -->
